===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|UK|Ireland|Commonwealth}} The [[punctuation mark]] "{{l|mul|'''.'''}}" (indicating the end of a sentence or marking an abbreviation).
# {{lb|en|figurative}} A decisive end to something.
#* {{quote-web|en|url=https://www.theguardian.com/film/2022/oct/22/its-a-way-to-bring-my-mum-and-dad-back-steven-spielberg-on-the-new-wave-of-cine-memoirs|title=‘It’s a way to bring my mum and dad back’: Steven Spielberg on the new wave of cine-memoirs|date=2022-10-22|author=Wendy Ide|quotee=Steven Spielberg|work=The Guardian|passage=[S]pielberg was keen to stress that ''The Fabelmans'' is not a '''full stop''': “It is not because I decided to retire, and this is my swan song, don’t believe that.”}}

