{{en-interj}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial}} Used to [[emphasize]] the end of an [[important]] [[statement]] or [[point]] when [[speaking]] to show something is not up for discussion or debate.
#: {{ux|en|We need more people to join IRC, '''full stop'''.}}

